    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "* * *\nhttp://www.judis.nic.in K.Murugesan vs Manogaran on 1 October, 2019 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/169526387/",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 724,
      "end": 852,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "K.Murugesan vs Manogaran",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 754,
          "end": 778
        },
        {
          "text": "1 October, 2019",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 782,
          "end": 797
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "1  2  ORDER",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 853,
      "end": 865,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "The petitioner is running a grocery retail shop in the name and style of Meenakshi Grocery store, at Haihindpuram, Madurai.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 866,
      "end": 989,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Meenakshi Grocery store",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 939,
          "end": 962
        },
        {
          "text": "Haihindpuram",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 967,
          "end": 979
        },
        {
          "text": "Madurai",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 981,
          "end": 988
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17914243042469025
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "The respondent herein purchased 80 packs of Prepacked Moon Brand Chicken 65 Masala which weighing 25 grams.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 990,
      "end": 1097,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3273887038230896
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Thereafter, he had sent the sample to the Food Analyst.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1098,
      "end": 1153,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.31946244835853577
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The Food Analyst had given a report that the Prepacked Chicken Masala in question had colours beyond the permitted levels and therefore it is unsafe.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1154,
      "end": 1303,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4413100779056549
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "Thereupon, the respondent filed C.C.No.207 of 2014 on the file of the Judicial Magistrate No.IV, Madurai against the petitioner as well as the manufacturer of the product.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1304,
      "end": 1475,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "C.C.No.207 of 2014",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1336,
          "end": 1354
        },
        {
          "text": "Judicial Magistrate No.IV, Madurai",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 1374,
          "end": 1408
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3116733133792877
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "The manufacturer of the product is shown as accused No.2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1476,
      "end": 1533,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.47333791851997375
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "The petitioner who is the seller of the product has been shown as accused No.1.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1534,
      "end": 1614,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3754086196422577
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "To quash the said proceedings, the Criminal Original petition has been filed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1615,
      "end": 1692,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.43727898597717285
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "2. Heard the learned counsel on either side.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1694,
      "end": 1738,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "3. In this case, the only ground for fastening the penal liability on the accused is that the product in question is http://www.judis.nic.in unsafe.\n4.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 1739,
      "end": 1891,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3762521743774414
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "The learned counsel appearing for the petitioner would point out that the petitioner being a seller can be fastened with the liability, if any of the conditions set out in Section 27(3) of the Food Safety and Standards Act 2006 are fulfilled.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1892,
      "end": 2134,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 27(3)",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2064,
          "end": 2077
        },
        {
          "text": "Food Safety and Standards Act 2006",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2085,
          "end": 2119
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.551766574382782
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "In this case, the petitioners will not fall under Section 27(3) (a)\nto (d) of the Act.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2135,
      "end": 2221,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 27(3) (a)\nto (d)",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2185,
          "end": 2209
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.641025722026825
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "The only ground on which the complaint has been filed is that the product is unsafe.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2222,
      "end": 2306,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6088663935661316
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "But then, the mere receiving of the unsafe products for sale is not sufficient to attract penal liability.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2307,
      "end": 2413,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6844313740730286
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "The seller must have received the unsafe articles with the knowledge of it being unsafe.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2414,
      "end": 2502,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6975508332252502
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "In this case, the products in question are prepacked items.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2503,
      "end": 2562,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6254745125770569
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "5. Therefore, it is only the manufacturer who can be fastened with the liability.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2564,
      "end": 2645,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.670014500617981
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "In the complaint,\nnowhere has it been averred that the petitioner herein received the same with the knowledge of it being unsafe.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2646,
      "end": 2775,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6312835216522217
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "The elementary ingredients of the offence in question are not fulfilled.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2776,
      "end": 2848,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5652828216552734
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "Therefore, the continuance of the impugned proceedings will be an abuse to legal process.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2849,
      "end": 2938,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6312189698219299
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "The impugned proceedings stand quashed as far as the petitioner is concerned.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 2939,
      "end": 3016,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.548129141330719
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "They will continue against the other accused.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3017,
      "end": 3062,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3955326974391937
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "http://www.judis.nic.in",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3063,
      "end": 3087,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "6. The Criminal Original petition stands allowed, on these terms.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3088,
      "end": 3153,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.06722493469715118
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "Consequently, connected Miscellaneous petitions are closed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3154,
      "end": 3213,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.06968949735164642
    },
